	"FriendlyName": "DualSlot - List & Grid Inventory",
	"Description": "A drop-in inventory component for any Actor. Choose List (linear, stackable slots) or Grid (spatial, Tetris-style with item footprints and rotation) per inventory via a Data Asset - no recompiling, no subclassing. Fully decoupled from UI through Blueprint-callable interfaces and granular events, with a replication-ready data layer for future multiplayer support.",
